From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:32:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] watchdog: s3c2410_wdt: add Google gs201 compatible

gs201 has the same two cluster watchdogs and PMU controls as gs101.
The bootloader leaves both running; with this the driver stops them
at probe instead of the phone resetting after about 60 seconds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/watchdog/s3c2410_wdt.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/watchdog/s3c2410_wdt.c b/drivers/watchdog/s3c2410_wdt.c
index e31f93db0..d45ba57c6 100644
--- a/drivers/watchdog/s3c2410_wdt.c
+++ b/drivers/watchdog/s3c2410_wdt.c
@@ -373,6 +373,8 @@ static const struct s3c2410_wdt_variant drv_data_exynosautov920_cl1 = {
 static const struct of_device_id s3c2410_wdt_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "google,gs101-wdt",
 	  .data = &drv_data_gs101_cl0 },
+	{ .compatible = "google,gs201-wdt",
+	  .data = &drv_data_gs101_cl0 },
 	{ .compatible = "samsung,s3c6410-wdt",
 	  .data = &drv_data_s3c6410 },
 	{ .compatible = "samsung,exynos5250-wdt",
